  "text": "## Technology Stack\n\nAVENIQ utilizes flexible, high-performance technology stacks for custom enterprise software development:\n\n- **Frontend Interface**: React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Next.js\n- **Backend API Layer**: Node.js, Express.js, TypeScript\n- **Database Management**: PostgreSQL, Supabase, Redis\n- **Containerization & Hosting**: Docker, Linux VPS (Ubuntu/Debian), Nginx, Cloudflare\n- **Version Control & CI/CD**: GitHub, GitHub Actions\n\n---",
